<worksheet>
    <title>Problem 4 - Homework MTH 305</title>

    <p>
        You should present solutions neatly to all problems, making sure to show
        all your work and follow the homework policies (see Blackboard document
        for details).
        You will turn in the assignment on Blackboard by 11:59 pm ET on Friday.
        The solutions you turn in should be your own work and written in your
        own words.
